<item>
  <title>PlantForAdapt funded by Velux Stiftung</title>
  <link>https://PlantForAdapt.github.io/news/260415_project_funded/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<div class="columns">
<div class="column" style="width:60%;">
<p>We are delighted to announce that <strong>PlantForAdapt</strong> has been selected for funding by the <a href="https://veluxstiftung.ch/">Velux Stiftung</a> under its 2026 Forestry call.</p>
</div><div class="column" style="width:5%;">

</div><div class="column" style="width:35%;">
<p><img src="https://PlantForAdapt.github.io/news/260415_project_funded/logo_velux.jpg" class="img-fluid"></p>
</div>
</div>
<p>The Velux Stiftung is a Swiss philanthropic foundation that supports research and projects in areas such as forestry, with a focus on long-term, high-impact initiatives.</p>
<p>This funding will allow us to launch our international collaboration between Brazil and France on native-species planted forests, and to develop science-based guidelines for resilient Amazonian landscapes in the face of global change.</p>
<p>Stay tuned for more updates as the project gets underway!</p>
